      "value": "@{629fc21f2b0c690b785dab7f|full_name} I would just add, It would be ideal if it checked the input URL's destination first, so that people who use vanity URL usernames fully can still have the icon. Mine for example https://bsky.invertex.xyz is still a BlueSky link.\n\nThis is a more ideal way to link your BSKY account and/or its content! Because if we ever needed to migrate to some other service, you can just update your server redirect. I can link my content like https://bsky.invertex.xyz/post/3lbltee7tz62n and it just works.",
